# Phase 7: named-write: options on Spectre (render::named::bench). A SPICE
# option is written only where Spectre has one of the same effect
# (Reference 19.1 pp.187-236: reltol #1, vabstol #3, iabstol #4,
# chargeabstol #5 for chgtol, temp #6, tnom #7, dcmaxiters #56 for itl1,
# scale #90, gmin #128, pivrel #181, pivabs #182 for pivtol); any other, a
# flag (ACCT) among them, is not written, noted W0024 (was copied by name,
# or a flag refused W0101). Per set: spice-bench 192, hspice 5.
hspice/hspice/cshunt_delmax.sp spectre an option written only where Spectre has its equivalent
