# Phase 7: spectre-read: a Spectre file's SPICE region (render::read::named
# `Rd::region`). A `simulator lang=spice` region's `.param` (HSPICE
# lexicon, Spectre UG p.53) whose values are expressions is read as
# `parameters`, its numbers in the region's suffixes; in a section the
# region is kept whole unless every statement is one. Per set: fixtures 6
# (one input).
