# Phase 7: integrate: Spectre port and pz written (render::named, capability
# RfPort/PoleZero). A port source is Spectre's `port` (Spectre Reference 5.0
# p.602: `dc`/`mag` across the terminated port, half ngspice's source behind
# `z0`); a `.pz` whose input pair has a source of its kind across it (`vol`
# a V, `cur` an I) is `pz (out) pz iprobe=<source>` (p.790), so a Spectre
# deck's own port and pz trip (test_sources/imported.rs). Per set:
# spice-bench 5 (five inputs).
spice-bench/ngspice/examples/sp/Tschebyschef-LP.sp spectre now written: V1, V2 (portnum, z0 50) are port num= r=50 dc=0 mag=500m / mag=0; was refused W0007
spice-bench/ngspice/paranoia/various/Tschebyschef-LP.sp spectre now written: V1, V2 (portnum, z0 50) are port num= r=50 dc=0 mag=500m / mag=0; was refused W0007
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/polezero/filt_rc.sp spectre now written: .pz 1 0 2 0 vol pz is pz1 (2 0) pz iprobe=v1 (v1 across 1 0); was refused
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/polezero/filt_bridge_t.sp spectre now written: .PZ 1 0 3 0 VOL PZ is pz1 (3 0) pz iprobe=v1 (V1 across 1 0); was refused
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/polezero/filt_multistage.sp spectre now written: .pz 1 0 6 0 vol pz is pz1 (6 0) pz iprobe=v1 (v1 across 1 0); was refused

# Phase 7: spectre-lin: Spectre's lin=N/log=N is N steps, N+1 points
# (Spectre Reference 19.1 p.43 ac #7 #9, "Number of steps"), so a SPICE
# `.ac/.noise/.sp lin N` is lin=N-1 and one point is values=[start]
# (render::named::bench::points; the reader adds the point back,
# render::read::named_bench). Oracle: ngspice's and VACASK's vector length
# (test_ngspice_analyses spectre_lin_counts_steps_so_one_more_point,
# test_vacask_runs spectre_lin_is_steps_on_vacask_too). Also changed, under
# earlier sections' lines: both Tschebyschef-LP (sp lin=99), diffpair_spiceManLIN
# (lin=99), diffpair_spiceManOld and lowpass_fd (values=[…]), the three
# ErrorTestAC/UnsupportedRemeasureTypes (lin=26/26/12).
spice-bench/ngspice/examples/inductive-systems/positive-definite-4.sp spectre .ac lin 5000 is lin=4999 steps; was lin=5000
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/regression/misc/ac-zero.sp spectre .ac lin 1 0 0 is values=[0]; was lin=1 (2 points)
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/regression/misc/empty-1.sp spectre .ac lin 3 is lin=2 steps; was lin=3
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/regression/sens/sens-ac-1.sp spectre .ac lin 1 is values=[1M]; was lin=1 (2 points)
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/regression/sens/sens-ac-2.sp spectre .ac lin 1 is values=[1M]; was lin=1 (2 points)
xyce/MEASURE_NOISE/InputNoiseOps.cir spectre .noise lin 10 is lin=9 steps; was lin=10
xyce/MEASURE_NOISE/OutputNoiseOps.cir spectre .noise lin 10 is lin=9 steps; was lin=10
